2. Inside the `addOnload` function, you can write your skip logic code using JavaScript. Here's an example of skipping a question based on a previous response:

```javascript
Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function() {
  var question1 = "${q://QID1/SelectedChoices}";

  if (question1.includes("option1")) {
    /* Skip question ID2 if option1 is selected in question ID1 */
    Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData('skipQuestionID2', true);
    Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData('skipQuestionID3', false);
