3. Configure your client-side application to authenticate using Kerberos.NET. Here's an example of how you can authenticate against a Kerberos service using the `KerberosClient` class:

```csharp
using Kerberos.NET;
using Kerberos.NET.Credentials;
using Kerberos.NET.Crypto;

...

var kdc = "your_kdc_hostname";
