    const chatContainer = document.getElementById('chat-container');
    const messageElement = document.createElement('p');
    messageElement.textContent = message;
    chatContainer.appendChild(messageElement);
}

// Example usage: sending a message
sendMessage("Hello!");
```

This code assumes that you have set up a server-side endpoint `/api/chat` for handling the API requests and `/api/chat/stream` for streaming responses. The server should make API calls to ChatGPT and route the responses back to the web page using Server-Sent Events (SSE).

