3. Create a method to convert the PDF to an image.

```java
public static void convertPdfToImage(String pdfFilePath, String outputFolderPath) throws Exception {
    // Load PDF document
    PDDocument document = PDDocument.load(new File(pdfFilePath));

    // Create PDF renderer
    PDFRenderer pdfRenderer = new PDFRenderer(document);

    // Iterate over the pages and convert each to an image
    for (int pageNumber = 0; pageNumber < document.getNumberOfPages(); pageNumber++) {
        // Render page to an image
        BufferedImage image = pdfRenderer.renderImage(pageNumber);

        // Set output file name
        String outputFileName = outputFolderPath + File.separator + "page_" + (pageNumber + 1) + ".png";

        // Save image to file
        ImageIO.write(image, "PNG", new File(outputFileName));
    }

    // Close the document
    document.close();
}
```

