public class GuessTheNumber {

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        // Generate a random number between 1 and 100
        Random random = new Random();
        int targetNumber = random.nextInt(100) + 1;

        System.out.println("Welcome to Guess the Number game!");

        Scanner scanner = new Scanner(System.in);
        int guess;
        int attempts = 0;

        do {
            System.out.print("Enter your guess (1-100): ");
            guess = scanner.nextInt();
            attempts++;

            if (guess < targetNumber) {
                System.out.println("Too low! Try again.");
            } else if (guess > targetNumber) {
                System.out.println("Too high! Try again.");
            } else {
                System.out.println("Congratulations! You guessed the number in " + attempts + " attempts.");
            }

        } while (guess != targetNumber);

        scanner.close();
    }
}
```

In this game, the program generates a random number between 1 and 100. It prompts the user to enter their guess, and based on their input, it provides feedback (if the guess is too high or too low). The game continues until the user guesses the correct number, at which point it displays a congratulatory message along with the number of attempts it took to guess correctly.

下面是一个用 Java 编写的示例代码，用于计算逆变器发电量并确定逆变器的运行水平：

```java
import java.util.ArrayList;
import java.util.List;
import java.util.Scanner;

class Inverter {
    private double capacity;
    private List<Double> powerGeneration;

    public Inverter(double capacity, List<Double> powerGeneration) {
        this.capacity = capacity;
        this.powerGeneration = powerGeneration;
    }

    public double getAveragePowerGeneration() {
        double sum = 0;
        int count = 0;
        for (Double generation : powerGeneration) {
            sum += generation;
            if (generation > 0) {
                count++;
            }
        }
        return sum / count;
    }

    public String getPerformanceLevel(double averagePowerGeneration) {
        double ratio = averagePowerGeneration / capacity;

        if (ratio > 1) {
            return "正常";
        } else if (ratio > 0.85) {
            return "稍差";
        } else if (ratio > 0.75) {
            return "较差";
        } else {
            return "极差";
        }
    }
}

public class InverterPowerGeneration {

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        // 输入逆变器信息
        Scanner scanner = new Scanner(System.in);
        System.out.print("请输入逆变器数量: ");
        int count = scanner.nextInt();

        List<Inverter> inverters = new ArrayList<>();
        for (int i = 1; i <= count; i++) {
            System.out.print("请输入逆变器" + i + "的装机容量（单位kw）: ");
            double capacity = scanner.nextDouble();

            List<Double> powerGeneration = new ArrayList<>();
            for (int j = 9; j <= 15; j++) {
                System.out.print("请输入逆变器" + i + "在" + j + "点的发电量（单位kwh）: ");
                double generation = scanner.nextDouble();
                powerGeneration.add(generation);
            }

            inverters.add(new Inverter(capacity, powerGeneration));
        }

        // 计算发电量和输出运行水平
        for (int i = 0; i < inverters.size(); i++) {
            Inverter inverter = inverters.get(i);
            double averagePowerGeneration = inverter.getAveragePowerGeneration();
            String performanceLevel = inverter.getPerformanceLevel(averagePowerGeneration);

            System.out.println("逆变器" + (i + 1) + "的平均发电量: " + averagePowerGeneration);
            System.out.println("逆变器" + (i + 1) + "的运行水平: " + performanceLevel);
        }

        scanner.close();
    }
}
```

这段代码首先会要求用户输入逆变器的数量，然后逐个输入每个逆变器的装机容量和每个时间点的发电量。随后，它会计算每个逆变器的平均发电量和运行水平，并将结果输出给用户。

请注意，这只是一个示例代码，并没有处理支路容量和支路电流对比的情况。您可以根据您的具体需求进行修改和扩展。

