8. For cells on the first row, dp[i, j] = dp[i, j - 1] + map[i, j] (can only move down).
9. For cells on the first column, dp[i, j] = dp[i - 1, j] + map[i, j] (can only move right).
10. For other cells, dp[i, j] = min(dp[i - 1, j], dp[i, j - 1]) + map[i, j] (can move either right or down, choose the minimum path length).
