	// ...
}
```

Make sure to replace `"path/to/client.crt"`, `"path/to/client.key"`, and `"path/to/rootCA.crt"` with the actual paths to your client certificate, client key, and root CA certificate, respectively.

By providing the client certificate and key using `tls.LoadX509KeyPair`, you are instructing the client to use that certificate for authentication when connecting to the server. Additionally, by adding the root CA certificate to the certificate pool, you are ensuring that the server's certificate is verified using the correct trusted CA.

