   For C# example:
   ```csharp
   private void numericUpDown1_ValueChanged(object sender, EventArgs e)
   {
       int textboxCount = (int)numericUpDown1.Value;
       panel1.Controls.Clear(); // Clear existing textboxes

       for (int i = 0; i < textboxCount; i++)
