		if err != nil {
			fmt.Println("Error sending keep-alive:", err)
			return
		}
		fmt.Println("Keep-alive packet sent")

		// Wait for some time before sending the next keep-alive packet
		time.Sleep(5 * time.Second)
	}
}
```

The server keeps a map of connections with their last seen timestamp. It removes the connection from the map if it encounters any error while reading or the client disconnects. The client sends a keep-alive packet every 5 seconds to the server.

