2. Connect the hardware as follows:
    - ESP32 Receiver:
        - Connect SDA and SCL pins to the respective I2C data and clock lines of the I2C device you want to interface.
        - Connect GND and VCC pins.
    - ESP32 Transmitter:
        - Connect SDA and SCL pins to the corresponding pins on the ESP32 receiver.
        - Connect GND and VCC pins.
