Next, we loop through the mesh triangles and calculate the tangent for each triangle using the `CalculateTangent()` method. The `CalculateTangent()` method takes three vertices and their respective normals and returns the tangent of the surface.

You can use the calculated tangent value for any further calculations or processing you require. In the example code, we simply log the tangent for each triangle.

